{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":22,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 22:1"},"A ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["good"]}," name ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," rather to be chosen than great riches, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," loving favour rather than silver and gold. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 22:2"},"The rich and poor meet together: the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the maker of them all. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 22:3"},"A prudent ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," foreseeth the evil, and hideth himself: but the simple pass on, and are punished. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 22:4"},"By humility ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," the fear of the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," riches, and honour, and life. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 22:5"},"Thorns ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," snares ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," in the way of the froward: he that doth keep his soul shall be far from them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 22:6"},"Train up a child in the way he should go: and when he is old, he will not depart from it. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 22:7"},"The rich ruleth over the poor, and the borrower ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," servant to the lender. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 22:8"},"He that soweth iniquity shall reap vanity: and the rod of his anger shall fail. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 22:9"},"He that hath a bountiful eye shall be blessed; for he giveth of his bread to the poor. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 22:10"},"Cast out the scorner, and contention shall go out; yea, strife and reproach shall cease. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 22:11"},"He that loveth pureness of heart, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["for"]}," the grace of his lips the king ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be"]}," his friend. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 22:12"},"The eyes of the LORD preserve knowledge, and he overthroweth the words of the transgressor. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 22:13"},"The slothful ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," saith, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["There is"]}," a lion without, I shall be slain in the streets. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 22:14"},"The mouth of strange women ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a deep pit: he that is abhorred of the LORD shall fall therein. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 22:15"},"Foolishness ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," bound in the heart of a child; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but "]},"the rod of correction shall drive it far from him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 22:16"},"He that oppresseth the poor to increase his ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["riches, and"]}," he that giveth to the rich, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall"]}," surely ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["come"]}," to want. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 22:17"},"Bow down thine ear, and hear the words of the wise, and apply thine heart unto my knowledge. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 22:18"},"For ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it is"]}," a pleasant thing if thou keep them within thee; they shall withal be fitted in thy lips. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 22:19"},"That thy trust may be in the LORD, I have made known to thee this day, even to thee. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 22:20"},"Have not I written to thee excellent things in counsels and knowledge, ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 22:21"},"That I might make thee know the certainty of the words of truth; that thou mightest answer the words of truth to them that send unto thee? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 22:22"},"Rob not the poor, because he ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," poor: neither oppress the afflicted in the gate: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 22:23"},"For the LORD will plead their cause, and spoil the soul of those that spoiled them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 22:24"},"Make no friendship with an angry man; and with a furious man thou shalt not go: ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 22:25"},"Lest thou learn his ways, and get a snare to thy soul. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 22:26"},"Be not thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["one"]}," of them that strike hands, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["or"]}," of them that are sureties for debts. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 22:27"},"If thou hast nothing to pay, why should he take away thy bed from under thee? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 22:28"},"Remove not the ancient landmark, which thy fathers have set. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:28"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PRO 22:29"},"Seest thou a man diligent in his business? he shall stand before kings; he shall not stand before mean ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men."]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 22:29"}]}]}
